meta {
  name: 8b. Merchant Sell Claim (Blocked in 30-second window)
  type: http
  seq: 9
}

post {
  url: {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/escrows/{{escrowId}}/sell
  body: json
  auth: none
}

body:json {
  {
    "requested_by": "acc_seller_001",
    "settlement_notes": "Merchant attempting to claim funds during 30-second return window"
  }
}

docs {
  **Merchant Sell Claim Test**: Merchant (`acc_seller_001`) attempts to claim funds while the product is in `DELIVERED` status and inside the 30-second return window.
  
  **Expected Result**:
  - `HTTP 400 Bad Request`
  - Error Detail: *"Money is held during the 30-second return window. Escrow funds cannot be released until the return period expires (X seconds remaining). Use /accept-early to waive return window."*
}
